  message: "Closed by PR #3514 (commit 9c4f1a1ae). ADR-0027 (Draft) lands the four-part ADR-0024 axis-declaration template instantiation for Symbol.kind: §1 Context (192-value cluster taxonomy from WI-dumiz-bikul), §2 Decision (Symbol.kind names source-language syntactic construct only; Cluster D framework-roles fold to Cluster A canonical + meta['framework_role']; Cluster E edge-labels reclassify as call_site or drop), §3 Detailed analysis (per-cluster fold targets — high-level only; per-value verdicts file as audit-findings docs per the convention recorded in this item's discussion), §4 Consumer pattern ((kind, edge_type, meta) per ADR-0023 §6 Phase 2), §5 Enforcement (axis_drift.find_drift with name_filter='SYMBOL_KIND', scripts/check-symbol-kind-drift), §6 Migration plan (four phases mirroring ADR-0023). Pure documentation: 4 files / 304 insertions / no code or tests. Subsequent phase tracker items (registry+linter, consumer migration, producer migration per cluster, schema bump) file once Phase 1 lands."  # 0b55
